The '''Silky Lichen''' is a {{Rare}} item used to craft the {{Item|Silk-Edge Sword}}. 

== Obtaining ==
=== Woods Race ===
'''Silky Lichen''' can be obtained by talking to {{NPCSprite|Gustave}} after beating the [[Woods Race]] in 18 seconds or less. Once unlocked, players can buy it from {{NPCSprite|Rusty}} for {{Coins|100,000}}.

