== Trivia ==
*There was a bug that allowed players to obtain a '''Silky Lichen''' instead of the {{Item|Pig's Foot}} in the [[End Race]], but it was patched since then. It was eventually properly added in [[Changelog/2019/November 11|v0.7.4]].
*There was a bug that would grant the player a '''Silky Lichen''' instead of a {{Item|Hunter Knife}} from the [[Woods Race]].

